/* Linux LP64 syscall decoder, one semantic row per supported raw mapping.
 * X86 uses the pinned upstream nr.h; the second column is Linux asm-generic.
 * RV64 hwprobe is architecture-specific, not an AArch64 syscall.
 * The argument-dependent clone dispatch remains in linux_syscall_abi.h.
 * Intentionally no include guard: caller defines and undefines the macros. */
